    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Class that checks to see if the protocol for an ideal stream is followed. A method will return false if that is not the case. This class is not itself an ideal stream - it is intended to be used with ideal streams for debugging. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
